      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prairie_View%2C_Kansas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Historically, the town’s name has been spelled Prairieview, reflecting early settlers’ preference for a single word.",
